# Screens and Navigation

- Keep screen containers responsible for orchestration, not heavy business logic.
- For new routes, follow existing navigator organization and naming in `src/navigation/`.
- Pass only required params through navigation; keep payloads small and typed.
- Do not break existing route names or parameter contracts without migration.

## UX consistency

- Reuse existing shared components before creating new UI primitives.
- Ensure every screen handles loading, empty, and recoverable error states.
- Keep side effects (analytics, fetches) in hooks or sagas, not inline in render code.
